cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OSIS in your research, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "OSIS: Optical Storage Intelligence Simulator"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-09-19"
abstract: >
  A physics-based Python library for simulating the complete optical readout
  channel of phase-change optical storage discs (CD, DVD, Blu-ray). Implements
  the Abelès Transfer Matrix Method for thin-film reflectance, Rayleigh scalar
  diffraction spot sizing, incoherent MTF modulation, optoelectronic signal
  conversion, and a three-component physical noise model (shot, RIN, thermal).
  Produces CNR and BER as primary outputs. Includes parameter sweep,
  One-At-a-Time sensitivity analysis, and an optional ML surrogate component.
